From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quill <siinspam@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 19:31:45 +0000
Subject: build(nako): pin eslint-plugin-react-hooks to 5.2.0

From 6.0 the plugin depends on two outside parser packages whose names
carry the upstream brand. The rebrand renames them and the registry has
no such packages, so every install failed fetching Node dependencies.
5.2.0 has no such dependency and keeps rules-of-hooks and
exhaustive-deps; the web config drops the rules only 7.x provides.

Co-authored-by: Nako <nako@quill.moe>

